   "source": [
    "## 8. Nominal response\n",
    "\n",
    "The original notebook plotted level, pressure, and control movement. This refreshed figure adds\n",
    "all three valves and marks the control bands explicitly. A useful controller should remain within\n",
    "physical bounds, move toward both setpoints, and avoid persistent valve saturation."
   ]
